         (@elements_transaction_locktime_spec)
### C.jet_elements_locktime_local.elements_transaction_locktime_spec_sem
elements_transaction_locktime_spec_sem
     : forall environment : jet_elements_prim.Elements.env,
       @eq
         (Monad.CIMonad.domain (Monad.MonadZero.to_Monad Option.option_Monad_Zero)
            (Ty.tySem (Word.Word (S (S (S (S (S O))))))))
         (@elements_transaction_locktime_spec
